This is first bail application filed by the applicant under Section 483 of BNSS, 2023/439 of Cr.P.C.
for grant of regular bail in relation to FIR No.784/2024, dated 08.10.2024, registered at Police Station - Maihar, District Maihar (M.P.) for commission of offence punishable under Section 376,
376(2)(n), 294, 506 and 450 of IPC.
